<title>SWEDEN: S&amp;P says affirms ratings for Sweden's Vattenfall.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P says affirms ratings for Sweden's Vattenfall.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. credit ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's on Wednesday affirmed the ratings of Swedish state-owned power group Vattenfall AB and Vattenfall Treasury AB.</p>
<p>It also removed all shortterm ratings from credit watch, while long term ratings remain on credit watch.</p>
</text>
